  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NUV - Young political involvement in Latin America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to raise awareness of the opportunities for political involvement among young people and young adults in Peru, but also the partner organizations from Chile and Argentina. One of the topics addressed in the workshops is how to advance gender equality, and how to raise awareness about LGBTQ+ and gender identity issues.</narrative>
  </description>
